<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title><%= baseTitle %> <%= title%></title>
    <script src="/javascripts/Throne/forThronePage.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/Throne/successionToTheThrone.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="login-container">
    <h2>👑🔪❌ 계승자를 입력하라 👑🫲</h2>
    <form id="succession-form" method="POST">
        <label for="studentnum">학번</label>
        <input type="text" id="studentnum" name="studentnum" required>

        <label for="name">이름</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>

        <label for="grade">학년</label>
        <input type="text" id="grade" name="grade" required>

        <button type="button" id="prepare-button">준비가 되었다</button>
    </form>
</div>

<div id="warning-modal" class="modal-overlay" style="display: none;">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <p>정말 준비가 되었는가?</p>
        <div class="button-container">
            <button id="confirm-button">예</button>
            <button id="cancel-button">아니오</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
